T:Whate'er My God Ordains Is Right
T:WAS GOTT TUT / GASTORIUS
C:Samuel Rodigast; translation Catherine Winkworth, The Chorale Book for England,1863
C:Severus Gastorius, historical tune
S:Music: Mobile Hymns PD-labelled Gastorius score; text: Winkworth1863 no.135
Z:New verified historical-text underlay; source-reference instrumental ABC retained separately
N:Three explicit melody subdivisions only: quarter37 into two eighths, halves45/53 into quarters. Pitches/order, harmonies and bar totals unchanged.
N:Five original Winkworth1863 stanzas. Medicine is sung in two syllables; original around wording retained.
N:This is a new rhythmic underlay edition, not a facsimile, modernGetty tune or exact recording arrangement.
N:Source-specific US public-domain basis; retain attribution and territory caveats.
